title Argo Workflows SSO Auto-Redirect Pattern

User [icon: user, color: grey]
Browser [icon: chrome, label: "Browser", color: blue]
Traefik [icon: server, label: "Traefik Ingress", color: blue]
Authentik [icon: lock, label: "Authentik IdP", color: purple]
ArgoWorkflows [icon: argo, label: "Argo Workflows", color: green]

// 1. First visit — no cookie
User -> Browser: GET workflows.company.com/
Browser -> Traefik: Request (no authorization cookie)
Traefik -> Browser: 302 Redirect /oauth2/redirect?redirect=/\n(priority 15, Path('/') matched)
Browser -> Authentik: OIDC Authorization Request
Authentik -> Browser: Google Login Page
User -> Browser: Google Login
Browser -> Authentik: Auth Code
Authentik -> Browser: Set-Cookie: authorization=token (HttpOnly)\n302 Redirect /

// 2. Second request — cookie exists, no redirect loop
Browser -> Traefik: GET / (with authorization cookie)
Traefik -> ArgoWorkflows: Proxy request\n(priority 20, HeaderRegexp matched)
ArgoWorkflows -> Browser: 200 OK — Dashboard
